  "content": "# Cards\n\nProvides container elements that wrap and separate content.\n\n```astro\n<div class=\"card preset-filled-surface-100-900 w-full max-w-md p-4 text-center\">\n\t<p>Card</p>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Hover\n\nHover styles are applied when the card is an `anchor` or `button` element.\n\n```astro\n---\nconst unsplashId = \"photo-1598305758677-7548ff30583b\";\nconst imgSrc = `https://images.unsplash.com/${unsplashId}?q=80&w=450&h=190&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D`;\n---\n\n<a\n\thref=\"#\"\n\tclass=\"card preset-filled-surface-100-900 divide-surface-200-800 max-w-md divide-y overflow-hidden\"\n>\n\t<!-- Header -->\n\t<header>\n\t\t<img src={imgSrc} class=\"aspect-21/9 w-full grayscale hue-rotate-90\" alt=\"banner\" />\n\t</header>\n\n\t<!-- Article -->\n\t<article class=\"space-y-4 p-4\">\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"h6\">Announcements</h2>\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"h3\">Skeleton is Awesome</h3>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<p class=\"opacity-60\">\n\t\t\tLorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Numquam aspernatur provident\n\t\t\teveniet eligendi cumque consequatur tempore sint nisi sapiente. Iste beatae laboriosam\n\t\t\tiure molestias cum expedita architecto itaque quae rem.\n\t\t</p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<!-- Footer -->\n\t<footer class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-4\">\n\t\t<small class=\"opacity-60\">By Alex</small>\n\t\t<small class=\"opacity-60\">On {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</small>\n\t</footer>\n</a>\n\n```\n\n## Presets\n\nProvides full support of [Presets](/docs/\\[framework]/tailwind-utilities/presets).\n\n```astro\n<div class=\"w-full space-y-4\">\n\t<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined p-4\">Card</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-brand p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-brand p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-brand p-4\">Card</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<hr class=\"hr\" />\n\t<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-primary-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-primary p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-primary-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-secondary-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-secondary p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-secondary-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-tertiary-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-tertiary p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-tertiary-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-success-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-success p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-success-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-warning-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-warning p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-warning-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-error-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-error p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-error-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-filled-surface-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-tonal-surface p-4\">Card</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card preset-outlined-surface-500 p-4\">Card</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n```\n",
